sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor T as Trainer
    actor S as Student
    participant LC as liveclass-service
    participant LK as LiveKit
    participant EG as livekit-egress
    participant V as recordings volume
    participant B as Browser

    T->>LC: POST /sessions/{id}/recording/start
    LC->>LK: start room composite egress
    alt no egress worker running
        LK-->>LC: times out
        LC-->>T: 503, nothing half-started in the database
    else worker available
        LK->>EG: job
        EG->>V: write the video file
        LC->>LC: remember egressId
    end

    Note over T,B: In the room, the trainer's browser also turns speech into text
    T->>B: speaks
    B->>B: speech recognition (captions)
    B->>LC: POST transcript lines
    LC->>LC: store live_transcript_lines
    S->>B: reads live subtitles (if the preference is on)

    T->>LC: End class, or stop recording
    LC->>LK: stop egress
    EG-->>LK: file finished
    LK-->>LC: webhook egress_ended
    LC->>LC: match egressId, set recordingUrl (an older capture cannot overwrite)

    S->>LC: GET /sessions/{id}/recording
    LC->>LC: enrolled or teaching? else 403
    LC-->>S: the whole file (no range support)
    S->>B: object URL in the video player
    B->>B: watermark with viewer name, blackout when the tab is hidden
